## English Summary (non-exhaustive)

You may use and deploy this software. **The canonical upstream is https://github.com/L-bit1/unifier only.**
Improvements should be contributed via Pull Request. You may **not** republish a standalone long-lived fork as a separate competing project.
See CONTRIBUTING.md for collaboration details.
